stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> QUEUED: erasure requested and model supports remote delete
    [*] --> ONSITE_TASK: erasure requested and model has no remote delete
    QUEUED --> SENT: device command poll, device authenticated
    SENT --> ERASED_CONFIRMED: command result success
    SENT --> RETRYING: failure or no result within retry interval
    RETRYING --> QUEUED: retry interval elapses, retries below ceiling
    RETRYING --> EXHAUSTED: retry ceiling reached, HR admin alerted
    EXHAUSTED --> CLOSED_BY_ATTESTATION: admin attests decommissioned, lost, wiped or replaced
    ONSITE_TASK --> CLOSED_BY_ATTESTATION: admin attests deleted on site
    QUEUED --> CLOSED_BY_ATTESTATION: admin attests device gone
    CLOSED_BY_ATTESTATION --> QUEUED: same serial authenticates again, item reopened, security event
    ERASED_CONFIRMED --> [*]
    CLOSED_BY_ATTESTATION --> [*]
    note right of CLOSED_BY_ATTESTATION
        Never shown as erased-confirmed.
        Punch and Form IX rows untouched,
        they never referenced the template.
    end note
